#: templates/admin/documentation.php:367
msgid "Hashed access tokens"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:368
msgid "Every token is hashed with SHA-256 before it touches the database. Plaintext keys are never stored, so a database leak does not hand anyone a working credential."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:375
msgid "Granular scopes"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/documentation.php:376
msgid "Read lets an agent look but not touch. Write adds create and update. Admin unlocks the destructive abilities — deleting content, reading error logs, repairing tables. Custom lets you tick abilities one at a time."
